      "title": "Trane Technologies' Q3 Earnings Beat on Strong Commercial HVAC Demand",
      "summary": "Trane Technologies (TT) delivered robust third-quarter 2026 results with EPS of $4.86 (up 25.3% YoY) and revenues of $6.76 billion (up 17.7% YoY), both beating consensus estimates. Strong commercial HVAC demand drove 20% organic bookings growth and a 73% surge in backlog to $12.5 billion. The company raised its 2026 revenue growth outlook to 13.5% from 11.5%, though operating margins contracted 40 basis points due to inflation and supply chain pressures.",
